      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I second this. Personally, I've had experiences where people stand far too close to me, and I really don't like when someone is practically in my face. Everyone has different comfort levels with personal space, and respecting those boundaries helps make interactions much more enjoyable for everyone. A little awareness and courtesy can go a long way.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
