      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "While I've not been personally affected by this that much, I have witnessed more than enough occasions where some users, (especially strangers), are not respecting my friends' personal space or boundaries.\n\nWhether caused by trolls or people with difficulties understanding boundaries, this is indeed a real issue and VRChat should put more focus into the comfort of their players.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
