      "restoredAt": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I personally haven't experienced this yet as until now I have been a desktop player and also have only been in spaces with people I know fairly well but I have seen many times in videos, streams and shorts where people have been either just existing in a space or making content actively and other people known to them or not have interacted with their model or pushed themselves into that persons space without asking or apologising. As someone who in real life is very touch sensitive this is something I find extremely uncomfortable to witness and even more so to experience and so I think this is a feature that should be included immediately to help improve the safety and user experience for all players.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
